    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "EBBEB87C4A16B63E",
      "text": "Me presentaré de nuevo, esta vez formalmente:\\nsoy Aroa, representante del Alto Mando.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "EBBEB97C4A16B7F1",
      "text": "Nunca pensé que un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a alumn[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa de otra academia,\\ncomo tú, fuera a participar en la Liga Arándano.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
