    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "EBBEBA7C4A16B9A4",
      "text": "Si te digo la verdad, todavía no sé si me parece\\nbien o mal... Pero eso es irrelevante.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "EBBEBB7C4A16BB57",
      "text": "Veamos... Tengo cierta predilección por los\\nPokémon de tipo Hada.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "EBBEBC7C4A16BD0A",
      "text": "Son tan rositas y tan monos...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "EBBEBD7C4A16BEBD",
      "text": "No se llevan nada bien con las cosas tóxicas o\\nmetálicas, así que sus puntos débiles son el tipo\\r\\nVeneno y el tipo Acero...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "EBBEAE7C4A16A540",
      "text": "Ay, perdona. Probablemente ya sepas todo esto.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EBBEAF7C4A16A6F3",
      "text": "Pero lo que debes saber es que esta vez voy a\\nusar toda mi fuerza al combatir contra ti.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EBC23C7C4A19CC61",
      "text": "Y, con ello, pretendo enseñarte algo...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EBC23B7C4A19CAAE",
      "text": "¡La fuerza que esconden las cosas monas![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EBC23A7C4A19C8FB",
      "text": "¡[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! ¡¡[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
